#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:5
#: 87ddd35f581e4202867452db31da0c06
msgid "OSD"
msgstr "OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:10
#: 04638819453c4be1a312ec1a27198b3f
msgid ""
"OSD functionality is provided for on-board OSDs using MAX7456-type chips and"
" external MSP based OSDs, including DJI Goggles, and goggles using "
"DisplayPort. This enables overlay of FC data on the video. Once enabled, it "
"uses various panel items that can individually be set active and positioned "
"on the screen using respective parameters. It allows to setup multiple "
"screen layouts and switch between those using a spare RC channel. It also "
"allows the display and change of sets of parameters using stick gestures or "
"RC transmitters, in certain cases."
msgstr ""
"OSD 功能适用于使用 MAX7456 类型芯片的机载 OSD，以及基于 MSP 的外部 OSD（包括 DJI 头显和使用 DisplayPort "
"的头显）。这可实现飞控数据叠加在视频上。启用后，可使用各种面板项，并通过相应参数分别设置激活状态和屏幕位置。它允许设置多个屏幕布局，并使用备用 RC "
"通道在这些布局之间切换。在某些情况下，还允许通过摇杆手势或遥控器显示和更改参数组。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:15
#: 3eb812a2b0f54dd5955fb9b63febf493
msgid ""
"Being an integral library of ArduPilot firmware, the OSD code provides the "
"prerequisites to be redirected to various backends other than MAX-type "
"chipsets, including testing on SITL setups without actual autopilot- or "
"video-hardware needed."
msgstr ""
"作为 ArduPilot 固件的集成库，OSD 代码提供了将输出重定向到除 MAX 类型芯片组以外的各种后端的先决条件，包括在无需实际飞控或视频硬件的 "
"SITL 环境中进行测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:18
#: 3f887f874d7b4ae687d764715cddca8d
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:20
#: fc03c02ec4ad4f4fa270e5d42a25170e
msgid ""
"To enable the OSD overlay on MAX7456-type chips, set parameter: ``OSD_TYPE``"
" to 1, reboot and reload parameters. This exposes the whole OSD parameter "
"group."
msgstr ""
"要在 MAX7456 类型芯片上启用 OSD 叠加，请将参数 ``OSD_TYPE`` 设置为 1，重启后重新加载参数。这将显示整个 OSD 参数组。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:23
#: 581fba2e6d11442c809f57a9431eb13d
msgid "To set a RC channel for screen switching, use parameter ``OSD_CHAN``."
msgstr "要设置用于切换屏幕的 RC 通道，使用参数 ``OSD_CHAN``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:25
#: c7d152c7098b4b83b066f7d30445712b
msgid "To set the units used to display, use parameter ``OSD_UNITS``:"
msgstr "要设置显示单位，使用参数 ``OSD_UNITS``："

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:27
#: 524bfe5ed65b46fd80662a39d3329d29
msgid ""
"``0`` = Metric (meters,kilometers,meters/sec,kilometers/hour,degs in C)"
msgstr "``0`` = 公制（米、千米、米/秒、千米/小时、摄氏度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:28
#: f10edf70fdc94a068a40750c852b36c7
msgid "``1`` = Imperial (feet, miles, feet/sec, miles/hour, degs in F)"
msgstr "``1`` = 英制（英尺、英里、英尺/秒、英里/小时、华氏度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:29
#: 01c0a8bcc6dd41dfb93e3d77015eec2c
msgid "``2`` = ArduPilot Native (meters,kilometers,meters/sec,degs in C)"
msgstr "``2`` = ArduPilot 原生（米、千米、米/秒、摄氏度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:30
#: e737948ff29f4d4a9c3b921cc5c5f950
msgid "``3`` = Aviation (feet, nautical mile, feet/min, knots, degs in C)"
msgstr "``3`` = 航空（英尺、海里、英尺/分钟、节、摄氏度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:32
#: 52f52fc794b840668d44c33e988ad9d5
msgid ""
"To set vertical and horizontal display offset (space at top and left side of"
" screen), use parameters ``OSD_H_OFFSET``, ``OSD_V_OFFSET``."
msgstr "要设置垂直和水平显示偏移量（屏幕顶部和左侧的间距），使用参数 ``OSD_H_OFFSET``、``OSD_V_OFFSET``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:34
#: 3bd45cc2b399432e8f06e18b4cf78240
msgid ""
"Several options can be set using :ref:`OSD_OPTIONS<OSD_OPTIONS>` (bitmask "
"selection):"
msgstr "可使用 :ref:`OSD_OPTIONS<OSD_OPTIONS>` （位掩码选择）设置多个选项："

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:36
#: acff11e23b66484ab0dbc04ea918e632
msgid "bit0 = Enable use of compact number+decimal point fonts"
msgstr "bit0 = 启用紧凑数字+小数点字体"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:37
#: 462acab21a43477794baabb29e545db4
msgid ""
"bit1 = Invert wind direction indicator (to point to the direction its "
"blowing from instead of toward)"
msgstr "bit1 = 反转风向指示器（指向风吹来的方向而非风吹去的方向）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:38
#: bf6ab53eeb3f455f915ec6a840c45f46
msgid "bit2 = Invert horizon roll direction"
msgstr "bit2 = 反转地平线横滚方向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:39
#: 09f4b628d3e8426eaf984c326115a80d
msgid "bit3 = Convert feet to miles at 5280ft instead of 10000ft"
msgstr "bit3 = 在 5280 英尺处将英尺转换为英里，而非 10000 英尺"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:40
#: 530a9f4ef9204830b5d77cc7fcfdbed6
msgid "bit4 = Do not display crosshair"
msgstr "bit4 = 不显示十字准线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:41
#: 3977a252fc3247d8a1909b04c199c807
msgid "bit5 = Translate arrow directions when using BF font set"
msgstr "bit5 = 使用 BF 字体集时转换箭头方向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:42
#: fb02f2be16d445bfb53ac6aacd167c68
msgid ""
"bit6 = Aviation style horizon when inverted (pitch moves horizon in opposite"
" direction)"
msgstr "bit6 = 倒置时使用航空风格地平线（俯仰使地平线朝反方向移动）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:44
#: d1e20812845c460c9f90a43234e333ce
msgid ""
"Several font sets are included and can be changed during runtime (and those "
"who can build the software can customize or add additional font sets....see "
"libraries/AP_OSD/fonts/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"内置了多种字体集，可在运行时更改（能编译软件的用户可自定义或添加额外字体集……参见 libraries/AP_OSD/fonts/README.md）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:46
#: 63e51deedfca4895b90eed6807673064
msgid ":ref:`OSD_FONT<OSD_FONT>`:"
msgstr ":ref:`OSD_FONT<OSD_FONT>`："

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:48
#: 679a9729cafd4c33b77f799e7ce94936
msgid "``0`` = Clarity (default). A clearly visible large font"
msgstr "``0`` = Clarity（默认），清晰可见的大字体"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:49
#: a8b87202291c4b56ad4dd6210574361a
msgid ""
"``1`` = Clarity Medium. Good visibility, less dominant than clarity default"
msgstr "``1`` = Clarity Medium，可见性良好，不如默认 Clarity 突出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:50
#: b4c1d16718ac46b78bf2a95b644f9110
msgid "``2`` = Betaflight.  bf- / inav-osd default style"
msgstr "``2`` = Betaflight，bf/inav-osd 默认风格"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:51
#: e541a94acd8c4d47bd2eb153e9b15861
msgid "``3`` = Bold. A bolder version of Betaflight"
msgstr "``3`` = Bold，Betaflight 的加粗版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:52
#: 6d57bb691d9d4d8a819ce2b4f4af5da7
msgid "``4`` = Digital. 80's LED clock radio style"
msgstr "``4`` = Digital，80 年代 LED 时钟收音机风格"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:54
#: 4918992c04f04205aeaf6c573c683f8f
msgid ""
"Onboard font options might be limited on 1 MB boards to save memory for "
"other features. However, font upload from SD card is supported. This allows "
"the user to choose from up to 10 font files (named \"font0.bin\" - "
"\"font9.bin\") placed in the root directory of your SD card. Additionally, "
"this allows the user to easily add individualized and/or customized language"
" charsets for the onboard OSD without the need to compile  individual "
"firmware. Runtime font changing using the parameter "
":ref:`OSD_FONT<OSD_FONT>` is unaffected."
msgstr ""
"1 MB 板卡上的机载字体选项可能受限以节省其他功能的内存。但支持从 SD 卡上传字体。这允许用户从放置在 SD 卡根目录下的最多 10 "
"个字体文件（命名为 「font0.bin」 - 「font9.bin」）中进行选择。此外，这使用户无需编译单独固件即可为机载 OSD "
"轻松添加个性化和/或自定义语言字符集。运行时使用参数 :ref:`OSD_FONT<OSD_FONT>` 更改字体不受影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:56
#: 555181bc027a484bba1704a72c257252
msgid ""
"MAVftp might be a convenient option to upload files to your SD card without "
"having to physically remove it from your autopilot. Font files, font editor,"
" and utilities to convert to a .bin file from .mcm are `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OSD/fonts>`__."
" If downloading the editor or a font's .bin file from this site, be sure to "
"use the ``Download` button, rather than selecting ``Raw``, and then right "
"click saving, as you would the .mcm or .py files."
msgstr ""
"MAVftp 可能是将文件上传到 SD 卡的便捷方式，无需物理取出 SD 卡。字体文件、字体编辑器以及从 .mcm 转换为 .bin 文件的工具位于 "
"`这里 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OSD/fonts>`__。如果从该网站下载编辑器或字体的"
" .bin 文件，请务必使用 ``Download`` 按钮，而不是选择 ``Raw`` 后右键另存，否则只适合 .mcm 或 .py 文件。"

