msgstr "可以设置多个用户自定义警告，当达到或超过警告级别时，相应的 OSD 面板项将闪烁"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:142
#: f5c2c27968c441c58037e75f8e3f2cf5
msgid ""
":ref:`OSD_W_BATVOLT<OSD_W_BATVOLT>` - Blinks battery voltage panel if less "
"than this value. 0-100V with up tenth volt precision"
msgstr ""
":ref:`OSD_W_BATVOLT<OSD_W_BATVOLT>` — 电池电压低于此值时，电池电压面板闪烁。范围 0-100V，精度十分之一伏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:143
#: 6395137f9020436d8799c6cee893f8bb
msgid ""
":ref:`OSD_W_RSSI<OSD_W_RSSI>` - Blinks rssi panel if less than this integet "
"percentage value. 0-99%"
msgstr ":ref:`OSD_W_RSSI<OSD_W_RSSI>` — RSSI 低于此整数百分比值时，RSSI 面板闪烁。范围 0-99%"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:144
#: 5139f450b37d471dbac99234238b34a1
